  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Expert - DG INTPA TEI SRHR, Bryssel - National Expert - DG INTPA TEI SRHR, Bryssel, S&#xc5;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert - DG INTPA TEI SRHR, Bryssel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser en sekundering vid DG INTPA som ska arbeta med H&#xe4;lsa och SRHR-fr&#xe5;gpr. Sekunderingen t&#xe4;cker enhetens h&#xe4;lsoportf&#xf6;lj, med fokus p&#xe5; privat sektor och att utveckla innovativa finansieringsprojekt inom h&#xe4;lsa samt sexuell och reproduktiv h&#xe4;lsa och r&#xe4;ttigheter (SRHR). Arbetet styrs av de externa prioriteringar som definieras i kommissionens strategier Global Health och Global Gateway. Tj&#xe4;nsten kommer att fokusera p&#xe5; policy- och strategiformulering samt analytiskt arbete inom h&#xe4;lsa och SRHR-finansiering inom utvecklingssamarbete.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution involves a secondment at DG INTPA, which will work on health and SRHR issues. The secondment covers the unit&apos;s health portfolio, focusing on the private sector and developing innovative financing projects in health as well as sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR). The work is guided by the external priorities defined in the Commission&apos;s Global Health and Global Gateway strategies. The role will focus on policy and strategy development as well as analytical work on health and SRHR financing in development cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
